Large buffers without the HugeTLB pool.

nvme_alloc_huge() first asks mmap() for MAP_HUGETLB pages and falls back to
posix_memalign() when the pool is empty.  LikeOS has no HugeTLB pool (and
no MAP_HUGETLB), so the attempt is compiled only where the flag exists and
large buffers come from the fallback directly.

